Package: fio-cli
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Dominik Chrastecky <dominik@chrastecky.cz>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.38), libssl3 (>= 3.0.0)
Description: Command-line client for Fio bank accounts
 Fio CLI manages Fio bank accounts, locally encrypted transaction data,
 transaction synchronization, and domestic payments.
